// BREAKOUT_GOOD_PRISONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2042136523" "Three hots and a cot in here... forget leavin'!"
// BREAKOUT_GOOD_PRISONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3413927101" "Why would I want to break out now? I'm on parole as of tomorrow!"
// BREAKOUT_GOOD_PRISONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3114060543" "I bet Cyrus was involved in this."

// BREAKOUT_BOMB_PLANTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1387436041" "Which one is the ground wire again?"
// BREAKOUT_BOMB_PLANTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1255815902" "Almost... there..."
// BREAKOUT_BOMB_PLANTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1464057458" "Just got a message: Longbow is on the scene and they are trying to retake the Yard."

// BREAKOUT_PUNCHING_OUT_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1036414090" "And take this! And this! And this!"
// BREAKOUT_PUNCHING_OUT_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2092185679" "And this is for ratting me out last week!"
// BREAKOUT_PUNCHING_OUT_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1514856691" "I could do this all day!"
// BREAKOUT_PUNCHING_OUT_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2893882288" "That's for the bad food!  And that's for making me wait for my mail!  And THIS..."

// BREAKOUT_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3074207895" "A great destiny? I'll believe it when I see it."
// BREAKOUT_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P324938320" "We don't have all night."
// BREAKOUT_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3020783872" "No time to chit-chat. It's go time!"
// BREAKOUT_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4208584154" "Be on the lookout for Longbow soldiers."

