// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_HOLDUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1785340306" "We don't want any more casualties than necessary."
// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_HOLDUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P93026439" "Don't be a hero. I hate heroes."
// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_HOLDUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1697581192" "This prison is now ours."
// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_HOLDUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2427099783" "You are nothing to us. Stand down if you wish to live."

// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_CONVERSE1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3599441161" "Man, we have to hurry this operation up."
// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_CONVERSE1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3819226180" "Are we almost done here?"
// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_CONVERSE1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1638770391" "Is that who we are looking for?"

// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_CONVERSE2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3066470320" "Shouldn't be too hard. The prison's defenses have proven to be useless against us."
// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_CONVERSE2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1938825452" "We should call in to the pilot to prepare for departure."
// BREAKOUT_ARACHNOS_CONVERSE2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P202803508" "I hope so. Longbow is making their move towards the Zig.  We must hurry."

